Falsifies `designware_mobile_storage::proofs::a_bring_up_starts_over_from_whatever_a_failed_one_left`.

The defect: bring-up no longer resets the controller before `CMD0`, so whatever a failed bring-up
left in it (a FIFO mid-transfer, the IDMAC armed, raw status still set) carries into the next.

Expected to fail: `assert!(first.controller_was_reset && first.powered && first.clock_enabled)`.
